== Content (content/*, mods/sagas_*/schematics) ==

Every saga is an adaptation of a third-party 3D model and keeps that model's licence.
content/<saga>/<landmark>/landmark.toml names the source, author and licence; each pack's
LICENSE and ATTRIBUTION.md list them. Only free licences are accepted (CC0, CC-BY,
CC-BY-SA, MIT); see CONTRIBUTING.md.

== AI disclosure ==

The tooling and mod code were written with AI assistance and reviewed by a human
maintainer. AI-generated models, if any, are flagged per saga (source.ai).
